@startuml
' Source: motaa-app/MASTER_REVERSE_ENGINEERING.md §6.8-6.9
title Myanmar calendar · Independent calculation flow
caption VERIFIED STATIC FORMULAS · Calendar rules do not depend on ephemeris positions
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF8F0
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFEF9
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #756020
skinparam ActivityFontColor #282B22
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #E8DDAF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #756020
skinparam ArrowColor #756020
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive civil date (day, month, year);
if (Calendar mode?) then (Hybrid)
  :Use 1582 reform boundary\nJDN 2361222;
elseif (Gregorian) then
  :Apply Gregorian rules;
else (Julian)
  :Apply Julian rules;
endif
:Calculate integer Julian Day Number;
:Estimate Myanmar year using solar-year constant\nand Myanmar epoch;
:Select era-specific watat parameters\nand exceptions;
:Calculate watat (intercalary year)\nand relevant full moon;
:Resolve Myanmar year, month\n(First/Second Waso or late month where applicable);
:Determine lunar day and phase\n(waxing / full / waning / new);
:Calculate independent weekday-based flags\nSabbath · Yatyaza · Pyathada\nand other observances;
:Return Myanmar calendar result\n+ traditional labels;
stop
@enduml
